    "charge_action": "One ChargeAction travels to the station (no-op if already there) then charges continuously to target_soc under linear dt = g * \u0394E.",
    "same_station_repeat_useful": "Under linear charging, a second same-station charge only adds energy if the first action left SOC below max. The first action could have chosen u=1 and reached max in one step. Repeats burn the loop-guard counter and are not scientifically required."
  }
